## MCP - Table Extractor

**Endpoint:** POST /webhook/table-extractor

**InputSchema:**
```json
{
  "required": ["data", "mistral_api_key"],
  "properties": {
    "data": { "type": "string", "description": "Image URL or base64 data" },
    "source": { "type": "string", "enum": ["url", "base64"], "default": "url" },
    "mistral_api_key": { "type": "string", "description": "Mistral API key" },
    "execution_mode": { "type": "string", "enum": ["online", "offline"], "default": "online" },
    "user_id": { "type": "string", "description": "User ID (optional, for tracing)" },
    "guild_id": { "type": "string", "description": "Guild ID (optional, for tracing)" },
    "user_request": { "type": "string", "description": "User request (optional, for tracing)" }
  }
}
```

**RFC-014 Context Support:**
```json
{
  "context": {
    "data": "https://... or base64",
    "source": "url"
  },
  "plugin_context": {
    "api_keys": { "mistral": "..." }
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { "tables": [...], "raw_markdown": "...", "table_count": 1 },
  "meta": { "provider": "mistral-ocr" },
  "_trace": { ... }
}
```

**API:** Mistral Pixtral-12B (Vision OCR)

